% expect-error: undefined
% Scenario: a bad form is refused. A dictionary without PaintProc is
% undefined in execform and nothing is painted.
<< /FormType 1 /BBox [0 0 10 10] /Matrix [1 0 0 1 0 0] >> execform
showpage
